    "The Coach needs your consent to use external AI. Grant it in Settings → Assistant.": {
      "comment": "C3 — server Coach error: missing consent receipt (server 403).",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Coach braucht deine Zustimmung für externe KI. Erteile sie unter Einstellungen > Assistent."
