    "Your iPhone can answer privately on-device, or your server's AI can give richer answers — your values leave the device for the server path. Your choice.": {
      "comment": "Coach consent surface — explanation when both on-device and server are possible (A6c)",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein iPhone kann privat auf dem Gerät antworten, oder die KI deines Servers gibt ausführlichere Antworten. Für den Server-Weg verlassen deine Werte das Gerät. Deine Wahl."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your iPhone can answer privately on-device, or your server's AI can give richer answers. For the server path, your values leave the device. Your choice."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je iPhone kan privé op het apparaat antwoorden, of de AI van je server kan uitgebreidere antwoorden geven. Via de server verlaten je waarden het apparaat. Jij kiest."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your iPhone has no on-device Coach, and no server AI provider is configured yet. Set up a provider (or your own key) to use the Coach.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein iPhone hat keinen On-Device-Coach, und es ist noch kein Server-KI-Anbieter konfiguriert. Richte einen Anbieter (oder deinen eigenen Schlüssel) ein, um den Coach zu nutzen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your iPhone has no on-device Coach, and no server AI provider is configured yet. Set up a provider (or your own key) to use the Coach."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je iPhone heeft geen Coach op het apparaat en er is nog geen AI-aanbieder op de server ingesteld. Stel een aanbieder (of je eigen sleutel) in om de Coach te gebruiken."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your iPhone has no on-device Coach. Your configured server provider can answer instead — your values leave the device for this. Consent once to use the Coach.": {
      "comment": "v0.7.1 W-COACH-FALLBACK — server Coach fallback for non-Apple-Intelligence iPhones.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein iPhone hat keinen On-Device-Coach. Stattdessen kann dein konfigurierter Server-Anbieter antworten. Dafür verlassen deine Werte das Gerät. Stimme einmalig zu, um den Coach zu nutzen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your iPhone has no on-device Coach. Your configured server provider can answer instead. For that, your values leave the device. Consent once to use the Coach."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je iPhone heeft geen Coach op het apparaat. De ingestelde aanbieder op je server kan in plaats daarvan antwoorden. Daarvoor verlaten je waarden het apparaat. Geef eenmalig toestemming om de Coach te gebruiken."
          }
        }
      }
    },
