        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belasting, hartslag en energieverbruik verschijnen hier zodra een wearable zoals WHOOP of Polar ze doorgeeft."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "1.4 B3 — Recovery empty-state body when the server reports no wearable reading (recoveryEmpty). One sentence; it names what the page shows and never denies the overview's recovery score."
