      "comment": "Medical (AUDITC): server wording records.life.auditC.intro, shown above the AUDIT-C result and form. Approved as server wording (Decision 16): en from server v1.47.0 messages `records.life.auditC.intro`, word for word; nl from server v1.47.0 messages `records.life.auditC.intro`, word for word.",
